<title>GERMANY: Siemens details nine-month results.</title>
<headline>Siemens details nine-month results.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to June 30: (in</p>
<p>millions of marks unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit		    1,705    vs   1,651</p>
<p>    Group sales			   71,200   vs   64,500</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders	     82,800   vs   66,900</p>
<p>    Group investment		    6,300    vs   4,900</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
